    {
      "id": "GH-46",
      "title": "[BUG] Warning Critical dependency en react-datepicker por require() dinámico",
      "type": "bug",
      "priority": 16,
      "status": "done",
      "assignedRole": "product-owner",
      "description": "Imported from GitHub issue #46 in The-Next-Security/TNS_TRACK_DEMO.\nURL: https://github.com/The-Next-Security/TNS_TRACK_DEMO/issues/46\nLabels: bug, dependencies, front-end, technical-debt\n\n## Idea general\n\n`react-datepicker` usa `require()` dinámico internamente para cargar locales de `date-fns`, lo que webpack 5 reporta como warning \\\"Critical dependency: the request of a dependency is an expression\\\". El `ContextReplacementPlugin` existente para `date-fns/locale` no cubre este caso porque el warning proviene del código interno del paquete.\n\n## Solución temporal aplicada\n\nSe agregó `ignoreWarnings` en `webpack.config.js` para suprimir el warning mientras no se corrija en el paque...",
      "definitionOfDone": [
        "issue imported into local product backlog",
        "work item reviewed by product-owner",
        "implementation approach defined",
        "item ready for sprint selection"
      ],
      "source": "github-issue",
      "repo": "The-Next-Security/TNS_TRACK_DEMO",
      "issueNumber": 46,
      "issueUrl": "https://github.com/The-Next-Security/TNS_TRACK_DEMO/issues/46",
      "labels": [
        "bug",
        "dependencies",
        "front-end",
        "technical-debt"
      ],
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-03T00:08:35Z"
    },
