      "description": "Imported from GitHub issue #33 in The-Next-Security/TNS_TRACK_DEMO.\nURL: https://github.com/The-Next-Security/TNS_TRACK_DEMO/issues/33\nLabels: bug\n\n## Contexto\n\nDurante la migración del schema legacy al nuevo schema (Issue #9 FASE 0), se detectó que el método `updateChannelThresholds` en `servicios/src/controllers/ubibot_Controller.js` intenta actualizar columnas que **no existen** en la tabla `ubi_canal`.\n\n## Problema\n\n```js\n// ubibot_Controller.js — endpoint PUT /api/ubibot/channel/:channelId/thresholds\nUPDATE ubi_canal\nSET threshold_min = ?, threshold_max = ?\nWHERE canal_id = ?\n```\n\nLas columnas `threshold_min` y `threshold_max` **no exi...",
